  "project_description": "Sites using Purge can use this module in order to send purge requests to a custom Cloudflare Worker (like Cache Tag ) rather than use Cloudflare's Purge API directly. Doing so can enable site owners to perform purging by Cache-Tag without an Enterprise account.\n\n NOTE: Since Cloudflare swallows the Cache-Tag header before it reaches the worker, the header has been renamed X-Cache-Tag .",
